  "keyFeatures": [
    "24/7 persistent cloud Chromium workstation with noVNC live stream",
    "Prompt-to-Bot AI engine: generate automation daemons from plain English",
    "Teach by Demonstration recorder: record browser actions and synthesize replayable workers",
    "Cookie session migrator: transfer authenticated sessions to the cloud pod",
    "Emergency 2FA relay: human-in-the-loop challenge handling for automated bots",
    "Multi-cloud provisioning: AgyDesk Managed, GCP, or Fly.io BYOC",
    "Multiplayer collaboration: shared live browser with presence cursors and role-based access",
    "Enterprise integrations: HubSpot, Salesforce, Google Sheets, Airtable, Slack, Telegram, HeyGen, ElevenLabs, S3/GCS",
    "Multi-model AI gateway: Gemini 2.5, Claude 3.7, GPT-4o, DeepSeek",
    "Credit economy: granular per-action billing for browser steps, vision, AI media, and proxies"
  ],
